Package: ensembleweather
Title: Client for the 'Ourea' Probabilistic Weather API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Harrison", "Bowden", , "harrison@oureawx.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ourea Technologies", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: The official R client for the 'Ourea' probabilistic weather
    forecast API <https://oureawx.com>. 'Ourea' serves ensemble forecasts for
    the contiguous United States: every value is a distribution computed
    from the full set of model members, so results come back as tibbles of
    quantiles (p10 to p90), the server's own probabilities of crossing a
    threshold, and window totals for precipitation and snowfall. Requests
    are built in one canonical form so they share the edge cache, responses
    are revalidated with an 'ETag' cache, and errors are classed
    conditions.
